                      }
                    },
                    "_lineno": 59,
                    "_col_offset": 4
                  }
                ],
                "values": [
                  {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\nYou are crafting an executive-level message that demonstrates thought leadership and strategic alignment.\n\nTONE: Strategic, confident, focused on business impact and organizational transformation.\nAPPROACH: Lead with macro trends, demonstrate understanding of strategic challenges, position yourself as a peer with complementary expertise.\nAVOID: Tactical details, overt sales language, assumptions about their specific pain points.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 38,
                    "_col_offset": 23
                  },
                  {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\nYou are crafting a professional message that emphasizes collaboration and mutual value.\n\nTONE: Professional, collaborative, focused on team objectives and operational excellence.\nAPPROACH: Reference their role and responsibilities, demonstrate understanding of their team's challenges, offer concrete value.\nAVOID: Overly formal language, generic value propositions, excessive deference.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 45,
                    "_col_offset": 25
                  },
                  {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\nYou are crafting a technical message for a senior technical authority (architect, principal engineer, tech lead).\n\nTONE: Technical peer, respectful but confident, focused on architectural decisions and technical excellence.\nAPPROACH: Reference specific technologies or patterns, demonstrate technical credibility, respect their authority on technical direction.\nAVOID: Marketing language, oversimplification of technical concepts, challenging their technical decisions.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 52,
                    "_col_offset": 25
                  },
                  {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\nYou are crafting a job-focused message that centers on role fit and candidate qualifications.\n\nTONE: Warm, professional, focused on alignment between candidate skills and role requirements.\nAPPROACH: Lead with relevant experience, highlight specific skills that match job description, emphasize career growth potential.\nAVOID: Generic qualifications, vague interest statements, over-selling unrelated experience.\n    ",
                      "kind": "None"
                    },
                    "_lineno": 59,
                    "_col_offset": 25
                  }
                ]
              },
              "_lineno": 37,
              "_col_offset": 29
            },
